Walk every directory and report chain-of-trust verification status

Usage: psptool verify [OPTIONS] <FILE>

Arguments:
  <FILE>  

Options:
  -r, --rom-index <ROM_INDEX>  [default: 0]
  -j, --json                   
  -v, --verbose                
  -h, --help                   Print help
